    "pages": [
        {
            "id": "greeting",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'Why hello, ' + q.player.username + '!';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page2');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page2",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Running around all over Kalos is actually rather tiring, is it not?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page3');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page3",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Oh yeah, I'm the one making you do that, aren't I? Terribly sorry about that!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page4');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page4",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Well, Serena may have already told you, but I found a way to power up the Mega Ring!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Before we get to that, however..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Let's talk about Mega Stones briefly."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "My theory is that they're special stones irradiated by the light--"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "the energy of the Legendary Pokémon--fired from the ultimate weapon 3,000 years ago."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page9');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page9",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "And that's what I think they are."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page10');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page10",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "It's even possible that stones like Fire Stones were what turned into these Mega Stones."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page11');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page11",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "So, what's the Mega Ring that you are holding?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page12');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page12",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "That mysterious stone transforms feelings felt toward Pokémon into some kind of wavelength."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page13');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page13",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "The Mega Ring works in a similar way to how this object over here works."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page14');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page14",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "It's an object that changes sunlight into a mysterious light."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page15');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page15",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "During the sunset, this sundial starts emitting light."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page16');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page16",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "This mysterious object has towered over the city here for over 3,000 years."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page17');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page17",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "It's relationship to the Mega Ring isn't understood at all yet."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page18');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page18",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Now, let's get down to the heart of the matter!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page19');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page19",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'' + q.player.username + '! Try touching the sundial!';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run playsound minecraft:block.bell.resonate ambient @s ~ ~ ~ 1 1 1');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page20');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page20",
            "speaker": "player",
            "lines": [
                "You touched the sundial."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page21');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page21",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "You were exposed to the Legendary Pokémon's energy in Team Flare's secret HQ."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page22');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page22",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "And the Mega Ring has absorbed the power of the sundial."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page23');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page23",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "These two powers have combined to upgrade your Mega Ring."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page24');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page24",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Now, it will react to underground Mega Stones, but only when the sundial is emitting light."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page25');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page25",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "I'm sure these stones hide in every corner of Kalos! Use this power to find them!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('particle cloud 1179 110 -276 2 2 2 1 100');",
                            "q.run_command('tp @e[x=1179,y=109,z=-276,dy=3,type=cobblemon:npc] 10000000 -50000 -10000000');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page26');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page26",
